OL,3,GNEWSACyclist dies after crash with
OL,4,Alorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe southbound carriageway has now
OL,7,Freopened but northbound remains closed
OL,8,Fwhile investigation work continues.
OL,9,FTraffic is queueing between the
OL,10,FLawrence Hill roundabout and The Retail
OL,11,FPark. There is a diversion in place
OL,12,Fwith congestion on nearby routes.
